# Shell scripts run on Linux: always LF, also in a Windows checkout
# (a CRLF script fails with "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter")
*.sh text eol=lf
# Batch files: always CRLF - cmd misreads labels (goto, call :x) in an
# LF-only .bat
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.epub binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.res binary
